msgid "Zinn® Order Updates"
msgstr "Zinn® Order Updates"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: zinn-order-updates.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates"

#. Description of the plugin
#: zinn-order-updates.php
msgid "SMS and WhatsApp order updates for your store, sent through Zinn® Campaigns under your store's own name. Connect in one click; no keys to paste."
msgstr "Taarifa za oda kupitia SMS na WhatsApp kwa duka lako, zilizotumwa kupitia Zinn® Campaigns chini ya jina la duka lako lenyewe. Unganisha kwa mbofyo mmoja; hakuna funguo za kubandika."

#. Author of the plugin
#: zinn-order-updates.php
msgid "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"
msgstr "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: zinn-order-updates.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:35
msgid "Order Updates"
msgstr "Taarifa za Agizo"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:86
msgid "Your store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns."
msgstr "Duka lako limeunganishwa kwenye Zinn® Campaigns."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:87
msgid "Your store is disconnected. No messages will be sent."
msgstr "Duka lako limetenganishwa. Hakuna ujumbe utakaotumwa."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:88
msgid "That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again."
msgstr "Muunganisho huo ulichukua muda mrefu sana au ulianzishwa katika kivinjari kingine. Bonyeza Unganisha tena."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:89
msgid "Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support."
msgstr "Zinn® haikukubali muunganisho. Bonyeza \"Unganisha\" tena; ikiwa itaendelea kushindwa, wasiliana na usaidizi wa Zinn®."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:90
msgid "Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again."
msgstr "Tovuti yako haikuweza kufikia Zinn®. Hakikisha kwamba mpangishaji wako anaruhusu miunganisho inayotoka nje, kisha ubonyeze «Unganisha tena»."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:125
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:56
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:57
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Usaidizi"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:128
msgid "Send your customers SMS and WhatsApp updates about their orders, under your store's own name, paid from your Zinn® credit."
msgstr "Watumie wateja wako taarifa za maagizo yao kupitia SMS na WhatsApp, chini ya jina la duka lako mwenyewe, zikilipwa kutoka kwa salio lako la Zinn®."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:129
msgid "Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this store, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key."
msgstr "Unganisha inafungua Zinn® katika dirisha hili. Ingia au ufungue akaunti, idhinisha duka hili, nawe utarudi moja kwa moja hapa. Hutawahi kubandika ufunguo."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:130
msgid "Connect to Zinn® Campaigns"
msgstr "Unganisha kwenye Zinn® Campaigns"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:136
msgid "Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly."
msgstr "Imeunganishwa, lakini Zinn® haikuweza kufikiwa sasa hivi. Tutajaribu tena hivi karibuni."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:141
msgid "Store"
msgstr "Duka"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:147
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Imeunganishwa"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:152
msgid "Zinn® Campaigns"
msgstr "Zinn® Campaigns"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:154
msgid "Open for your account"
msgstr "Wazi kwa akaunti yako"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:155
msgid "Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is."
msgstr "Bado haijafunguliwa kwa ajili ya akaunti yako. Zinn® itakutumia barua pepe itakapokuwa tayari."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:159
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Tenganisha"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-connect.php:77
msgid "You are not allowed to connect this store."
msgstr "Huruhusiwi kuunganisha duka hili."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-connect.php:152
msgid "You are not allowed to disconnect this store."
msgstr "Huruhusiwi kukata muunganisho wa duka hili."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:46
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Muunganisho"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:88
msgid "You are not allowed to do that."
msgstr "Huruhusiwi kufanya hivyo."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:215
msgid "Thank you. You can now ask for help and send reports to Zinn® support."
msgstr "Asante. Sasa unaweza kuomba usaidizi na kutuma ripoti kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:216
msgid "Consent withdrawn. Nothing is sent to Zinn® support until you agree again."
msgstr "Idhini imeondolewa. Hakuna kitakachotumwa kwa usaidizi wa Zinn® hadi utakapokubali tena."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:217
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:357
msgid "The Zinn® AI could not answer just now. Send your question to the team below; a person will reply."
msgstr "AI ya Zinn® haikuweza kujibu sasa hivi. Tuma swali lako kwa timu iliyo hapa chini; mtu atajibu."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:218
msgid "Glad that solved it."
msgstr "Imefurahisha kwamba hilo limetatua tatizo."

#. translators: %s: the ticket reference, such as ZT-7KQ3MX.
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:220
#, php-format
msgid "Sent. Your ticket is %s; the team replies here and by e-mail."
msgstr "Imetumwa. Tiketi yako ni %s; timu itajibu hapa na kupitia barua pepe."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:221
msgid "Fill in the subject, the message and, while your store is not connected, your e-mail address."
msgstr "Jaza mada, ujumbe na, wakati duka lako halijaunganishwa, anwani yako ya barua pepe."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:222
msgid "Zinn® did not accept the ticket. Check the fields and try again; if it keeps failing, e-mail support@zinndigital.com."
msgstr "Zinn® haikukubali tiketi. Kagua sehemu husika na ujaribu tena; ikiendelea kushindikana, tuma barua pepe kwa support@zinndigital.com."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:223
msgid "Too many requests in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again."
msgstr "Maombi mengi mno kwa muda mfupi. Subiri dakika chache kisha ujaribu tena."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:224
msgid "Reply sent."
msgstr "Jibu limetumwa."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:225
msgid "That ticket is closed. Send a new ticket instead."
msgstr "Tiketi hiyo imefungwa. Tuma tiketi mpya badala yake."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:226
msgid "Your reply could not be sent. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Jibu lako halikuweza kutumwa. Jaribu tena baada ya muda mfupi."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:241
msgid "Waiting on Zinn® support"
msgstr "Inasubiri usaidizi wa Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:243
msgid "Waiting on you"
msgstr "Inakusubiri wewe"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:245
msgid "Answered"
msgstr "Imejibiwa"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:247
msgid "Closed"
msgstr "Imefungwa"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:260
msgid "Report a bug"
msgstr "Ripoti hitilafu"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:262
msgid "Send feedback"
msgstr "Tuma maoni"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:264
msgid "Request a feature"
msgstr "Omba kipengele"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:266
msgid "Ask for help"
msgstr "Omba usaidizi"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:277
msgid "Versions: WordPress, PHP, this plugin, WooCommerce (and whether it uses HPOS) and the supported plugins we detected"
msgstr "Toleo: WordPress, PHP, programu-jalizi hii, WooCommerce (na kama inatumia HPOS) na programu-jalizi zinazotumika tulizozigundua"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:279
msgid "Your active theme and its version"
msgstr "Mandhari yako amilifu na toleo lake"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:281
msgid "The list of installed plugins, their versions and whether each is active"
msgstr "Orodha ya programu-jalizi zilizosakinishwa, matoleo yake na ikiwa kila moja inatumika"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:283
msgid "Connection: your store address, whether it is connected, this install's id and whether Zinn® answered its last check (never the store's token)"
msgstr "Muunganisho: anwani ya duka lako, ikiwa limeunganishwa, kitambulisho cha usakinishaji huu na ikiwa Zinn® ilijibu ukaguzi wake wa mwisho (kamwe si tokeni ya duka)"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:304
msgid "Zinn® Order Updates: Help"
msgstr "Masasisho ya Maagizo ya Zinn®: Usaidizi"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:318
msgid "Withdraw my consent to send help requests"
msgstr "Ondoa idhini yangu ya kutuma maombi ya usaidizi"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:326
msgid "Help here is answered by Zinn Digital® Ltd. Before anything leaves your site, this is exactly what is sent, and where:"
msgstr "Msaada hapa unajibiwa na Zinn Digital® Ltd. Kabla ya chochote kuondoka kwenye tovuti yako, hiki ndicho hasa kinachotumwa, na wapi:"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:328
msgid "A question you type: sent to the Zinn® AI at api.zinndigital.com, which answers from the Zinn® help articles."
msgstr "Swali unaloandika: hutumwa kwa Zinn® AI kwenye api.zinndigital.com, ambayo hujibu kutoka kwa makala za usaidizi za Zinn®."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:329
msgid "A ticket you send: its subject, your message, your admin language and a reply e-mail address, sent to Zinn® support."
msgstr "Tiketi unayotuma: somo lake, ujumbe wako, lugha yako ya msimamizi na anwani ya barua pepe ya kujibu, iliyotumwa kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:330
msgid "Diagnostics: only the blocks you tick, each shown in full before you send. Never the store's token, passwords or your customers' details."
msgstr "Uchunguzi: vizuizi unavyoweka tiki pekee, kila kimoja kikionyeshwa kikamilifu kabla ya kutuma. Kamwe si tokeni ya duka, manenosiri au maelezo ya wateja wako."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:331
msgid "Your tickets: while your store is connected, this screen reads your tickets and the team's replies from Zinn®."
msgstr "Tiketi zako: duka lako likiwa limeunganishwa, skrini hii husoma tiketi zako na majibu ya timu kutoka Zinn®."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:333
msgid "We record who agreed and when. You can withdraw at any time on this screen."
msgstr "Tunarekodi ni nani aliyekubali na lini. Unaweza kuondoa idhini wakati wowote kwenye skrini hii."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:335
msgid "Agree and continue"
msgstr "Kubali na uendelee"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:344
msgid "Ask the Zinn® AI"
msgstr "Uliza Zinn® AI"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:346
msgid "What do you need help with?"
msgstr "Unahitaji msaada gani?"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:348
msgid "Ask"
msgstr "Uliza"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:363
msgid "Help articles"
msgstr "Makala ya usaidizi"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:378
msgid "That solved it"
msgstr "Hii imetatua tatizo"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:379
msgid "Still need help? Send it to the team below."
msgstr "Bado unahitaji usaidizi? Itume kwa timu iliyo hapa chini."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:391
msgid "Send it to the Zinn® team"
msgstr "Itume kwa timu ya Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:396
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "Ni nini?"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:401
msgid "Subject"
msgstr "Mada"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:402
msgid "What happened? For a bug, the steps that show it."
msgstr "Nini kilitokea? Kwa hitilafu, hatua zinazoionyesha."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:403
msgid "Reply e-mail"
msgstr "Barua pepe ya kujibu"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:406
msgid "Leave empty to use the e-mail of the Zinn® member who connected this store."
msgstr "Acha wazi ili utumie barua pepe ya mwanachama wa Zinn® aliyeunganisha duka hili."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:410
msgid "Your store is not connected, so the team replies by e-mail."
msgstr "Duka lako halijaunganishwa, kwa hivyo timu hujibu kupitia barua pepe."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:413
msgid "Diagnostics (optional). Tick a block to attach it; this is exactly what is sent."
msgstr "Uchunguzi (si lazima). Weka alama kwenye kisanduku ili kukiambatanisha; hiki ndicho hasa kinachotumwa."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:420
msgid "Send to Zinn® support"
msgstr "Tuma kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:429
msgid "My tickets"
msgstr "Tiketi zangu"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:431
msgid "Connect your store to follow your tickets here. Until then the team replies by e-mail."
msgstr "Unganisha duka lako ili kufuatilia tiketi zako hapa. Hadi wakati huo, timu hujibu kwa barua pepe."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:436
msgid "Your tickets could not be loaded just now. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Tiketi zako hazikuweza kupakiwa sasa hivi. Jaribu tena baada ya muda mfupi."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:441
msgid "No tickets yet."
msgstr "Bado hakuna tiketi."

#. translators: %s: the date and time of the reply.
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:459
#, php-format
msgid "Zinn® support replied on %s:"
msgstr "Usaidizi wa Zinn® ulijibu mnamo %s:"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:466
msgid "Your reply"
msgstr "Jibu lako"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:468
msgid "Send reply"
msgstr "Tuma jibu"

#. translators: %s: the Zinn Digital trade mark, which is not translated.
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-promo.php:349
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-promo.php:407
#, php-format
msgid "%s — guides and services"
msgstr "%s — miongozo na huduma"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-promo.php:364
msgid "User guides"
msgstr "Miongozo ya mtumiaji"

#. translators: %s: this plugin's name, e.g. "Zinn® Cache".
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-promo.php:414
#, php-format
msgid "Read the %s user guide"
msgstr "Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-promo.php:422
msgid "Hide this"
msgstr "Ficha hii"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-promo.php:535
msgid "Zinn® hosting for WordPress"
msgstr "Ukaribishaji wa Zinn® kwa WordPress"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-promo.php:536
msgid "LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site."
msgstr "LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamishaji wa bila malipo na paneli dhibiti iliyojengwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha tovuti zaidi ya moja."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-promo.php:542
msgid "The Zinn® marketplace"
msgstr "Soko la Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-promo.php:543
msgid "Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy."
msgstr "Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizodumu, vikoa na nafasi za viungo, huku pesa zikiwekwa salama hadi pande zote mbili ziridhike."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-promo.php:590
msgid "Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living"
msgstr "Zinn Hub® — waajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii kama taaluma yao"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-promo.php:591
msgid "Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid."
msgstr "Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari huduma zaidi ya 10,000 zilizo tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, wasanidi programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwape nafasi ya kutuma maombi."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-updater.php:253
msgid "See the Zinn Digital® release notes."
msgstr "Tazama maelezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-updater.php:302
msgid "The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again."
msgstr "Huduma ya usasishaji ya Zinn® haikutoa kiungo cha kupakua kwa sasisho hili. Angalia kuwa tovuti hii inaweza kufikia jukwaa la Zinn®, kisha ujaribu tena."

#. translators: %s: the download error reported by WordPress.
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-updater.php:316
#, php-format
msgid "The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "Sasisho halikuweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwa huduma ya sasisho ya Zinn® (%s). Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-updater.php:330
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed."
msgstr "Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa ukaguzi wa uadilifu na halijasakinishwa."
